{"full":"hf:hugging-apps/krea2-turbo-sda-demo","spaceId":"hugging-apps/krea2-turbo-sda-demo","name":"Krea 2 Turbo SDA Diversity LoRA","source":"huggingface","description":"Same prompt, many seeds - diversity LoRA for Krea 2 Turbo","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":33,"created":"2026-08-31T12:05:18.000Z","updated":"2026-08-31T13:02:32.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://hugging-apps-krea2-turbo-sda-demo.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hugging-apps/krea2-turbo-sda-demo","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:04.423Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:04.423Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:04.423Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🎲","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Demo for F16/krea2-turbo-sda, a rank-32 LoRA for Krea 2 Turbo trained with SDA (Semantic Directional Alignment) to restore the sampling diversity that the Turbo distillation removed — without losing image quality or prompt adherence.","Because the LoRA's effect only appears across seeds, the demo samples one prompt with several seeds twice: plain Krea 2 Turbo on the left, Turbo + SDA LoRA on the right, using the same seeds on both sides.","Gating. The LoRA is trained at a single high-noise sigma node (σ = 0.9567, the second step of the 8-step Turbo schedule) and must only be active for the first 2 of the 8 denoise steps — the demo does this with a callbackonstepend that calls pipe.disablelora() after the gate step. The gate is exposed in Advanced settings so you can see the documented quality collapse at gate = 8."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hugging-apps/krea2-turbo-sda-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"521b986b8ccd48b16150b2b9943ed8419b942c05873563858cb7d410125880ec","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T06:43:39.403Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:04.509Z","projectInsights":{"version":1